00:17:55.101 --> 00:17:57.665
-$250 on the Bengals.

00:17:57.665 --> 00:17:59.514
If he's right,
I'll be back here next week.

00:17:59.514 --> 00:18:00.712
-Sounds great.
See you next week. [ laughs ]

00:18:00.813 --> 00:18:03.549
-We'll figure that out by then.
Simms, Lefkoe, back to you.

00:18:04.560 --> 00:18:07.155
So, my man Allie
is going Bengals.

00:18:07.155 --> 00:18:09.962
I do like a good defense at home
on Thursday night,

00:18:09.962 --> 00:18:11.893
but does he get
the Simms stamp of approval?

00:18:11.906 --> 00:18:14.618
-The Bengals have had
the Ravens' number

00:18:14.618 --> 00:18:16.784
the last few years,
but I'm going with the Ravens.

00:18:16.784 --> 00:18:18.454
I think this is a different
Ravens football team this year.

00:18:18.454 --> 00:18:20.735
-Really.
-A true Super Bowl contender.

00:18:20.735 --> 00:18:21.589
-And they're finally healthy.
-Yes, they are.

00:18:21.589 --> 00:18:23.152
-If they can avoid penalties.
-Right.

00:18:23.152 --> 00:18:25.115
-If there's a lot of penalties
in your game,

00:18:25.127 --> 00:18:26.656
we're keeping the same hashtag,

00:18:26.670 --> 00:18:28.944
and you're frustrated
with the refs,

00:18:28.944 --> 00:18:31.734
hit them with the hashtag
#KeepItInYourPants.

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:33.389
-We're talking about
flags and the referees.

00:18:33.393 --> 00:18:35.271
-Thank you.
-Yeah.

00:18:35.271 --> 00:18:37.656
-Clarification Simms.
-Yep.

00:18:37.656 --> 00:18:40.706
-Sam Darnold --
I'm so happy for our young man.

00:18:40.706 --> 00:18:43.415
-Sammy the Savior!
-We welcomed him to New York.

00:18:43.415 --> 00:18:46.384
Is he finally the answer
to the Jets' quarterback woes?

00:18:46.384 --> 00:18:47.551
-I do think so.

00:18:47.551 --> 00:18:50.635
And throw a pick-six
on your first play ever...

00:18:50.635 --> 00:18:52.111
and then just act like
it didn't even happen

00:18:52.116 --> 00:18:54.396
and come back
and ball after that?

00:18:54.402 --> 00:18:56.213
That's why they
took him number 3.

00:18:56.220 --> 00:18:58.095
Way to go, Sammy!
-Sammy! Sam is a pro.

00:18:58.095 --> 00:18:59.977
We're gonna
eventually become pros.

00:18:59.988 --> 00:19:01.299
For Simms...
-Peace out, homies.

00:19:01.291 --> 00:19:02.911
-...I'm Lefkoe.

00:19:03.157 --> 00:19:03.942
We'll holla, holla, holla
at you next week.

00:19:06.054 --> 00:19:07.389
-Yeah.
-So, stand right here.

00:19:07.389 --> 00:19:08.867
-We'll make it quick, Sean.
-You stand here.

00:19:08.870 --> 00:19:09.987
Face the camera
a little bit more.

00:19:10.016 --> 00:19:11.512
-Yeah.
-Okay.

00:19:11.496 --> 00:19:13.605
Hello and welcome.
I am split right now --

00:19:13.612 --> 00:19:15.308
No, this one, Sean. 

00:19:15.322 --> 00:19:16.866
He doesn't know
where the cameras are,

00:19:16.870 --> 00:19:18.838
but they're football brainiacs.

